11
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:46,570
(Fireworks Festival)
(July 24th, start at 7 PM)

12
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,070
Today's fireworks festival!

13
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:55,410
Get in a good mood with Mukai
during the fireworks.

14
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:58,200
It will be your chance to
get ahead of Minase.

15
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,080
