102
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:45,930
Sakisaki...

103
00:06:49,890 --> 00:06:51,600
Naoya.

104
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,560
Sa... Saki.

105
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:57,510
Naoya.

106
